    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 140 Donomore Crescent to the market, a three-bedroom end of terrace home situated in one of Tallaght's most established and convenient residential locations.\nOffering bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this charming property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families, and investors alike. Extending to approximately 81 sq. m, the accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious living room, and a fully fitted kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs features three generously sized bedrooms and a family bathroom.\nOutside, the property enjoys a private rear garden, providing an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining, while the front benefits from a driveway offering valuable off-street parking.\nDonomore is a mature and sought-after development, with an excellent range of amenities close by including primary and secondary schools, local shops, parks, sporting facilities, and regular public transport services. Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, TU Dublin Tallaght Campus, Tallaght Hospital, and the M50 motorway are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\nThis fantastic home combines comfortable living with a superb location and is expected to attract strong interest. Early viewing is highly recommended—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange your appointment.\nDetails\n3 bed, 1 bath\nEnd of terrace property\nc.81 sqm\nBuilt c.1968\nLow maintenance rear garden\nDriveway with off-street parking\nMature and well-established residential location\nGas fired central heating\nClose to local shops, schools & amenities\nExcellent public transport links nearby\nIdeal for first-time buyers\nEarly viewing is highly advised!\n\nBER\nBER: G\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 T9RH"
      },
      {
